// expect: 22
// The decls-column facet's fixture (the bound-projection stamp's gate):
// three fn decls, with `twice` and `main` MENTIONING `inc` — under the
// retired whole-handle NBound walk every fn-typed mention seeded the
// queue alongside its decl (N copies of one decl's candidates); the
// decls column seeds exactly the judged decls. The frontier leg queries
// "decls" and asserts each decl line is listed and no mention line is.
fn inc(x) = x + 1

fn twice(x) = inc(inc(x))

fn main() = twice(20)
